{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246880/extras/b59769c2a11544eedf9951175bb0a135.avif?t=1763139027\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Very dangerous alliances are being forged between the wrong demons.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City of Dolorosa is an interactive fiction and first-person exploration game that blends walking simulator and visual novel elements. Both the environments and characters are hand-drawn using india ink in a colorful and vibrant style.</strong> <strong>Set in a city of Hell inhabited by bizarre demons, you will be caught up in a battle for power, with several possible endings.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Dolorosa</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dive into an underworld full of quirky characters, and learn about their stories while you figure out your own destiny. Encounter two-dimensional creatures roaming a three-dimensional city, all entirely hand-drawn using india ink.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246880/extras/712ad85723e34e5d13235fd384c3c575.poster.avif?t=1763139027\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246880/extras/712ad85723e34e5d13235fd384c3c575.webm?t=1763139027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246880/extras/712ad85723e34e5d13235fd384c3c575.mp4?t=1763139027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get to know your demons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Interact with multiple characters in visual-novel styled conversations with branching dialogues, where your choices may affect the course of your journey. Unveil the main story and the different subplots that surround the inhabitants of Dolorosa.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246880/extras/6e19bfc1dd53d054ba7a81afe67be735.poster.avif?t=1763139027\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246880/extras/6e19bfc1dd53d054ba7a81afe67be735.webm?t=1763139027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246880/extras/6e19bfc1dd53d054ba7a81afe67be735.mp4?t=1763139027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover your fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You\u2019ve been sentenced to a lifetime in Hell and you still can\u2019t fathom why. Before you know, you\u2019ve found yourself involved in a plot of demonic power succession, of which you\u2019ll play a key role. Wander through the streets of the City of Dolorosa, meet the Five Great Powers and shed light upon your soul\u2019s fate.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246880/extras/5004b4431d55a81a7602f682254f8aea.poster.avif?t=1763139027\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246880/extras/5004b4431d55a81a7602f682254f8aea.webm?t=1763139027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246880/extras/5004b4431d55a81a7602f682254f8aea.mp4?t=1763139027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>About 4 hours of goofy words put together - alternating between absurd comedy, satire and horror thriller</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hand-drawn india ink graphics</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unique character designs based in demonology and a variety of deities</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Quirky humor and branching dialogues in a visual-novel style</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>3 main characters to choose from with different personalities</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Interactive city with lots of secrets to uncover</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Multiple endings depending on your actions</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Available languages: Spanish, English and Catalan (more in the future!)</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3246880?t=1763139027","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3246880?t=1763139027","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246880/4d227905bd0a5989fc716c50d4673b1a97a29c95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763139027","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246880/4d227905bd0a5989fc716c50d4673b1a97a29c95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763139027","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"There are some characters who are partially or completely nude. There are also depictions of nudity/genitals in 